<title>USA: Caterpillar developing larger mining truck.</title>
<headline>Caterpillar developing larger mining truck.</headline>
<dateline>PEORIA, Ill. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caterpillar Inc said Friday it is moving forward on the design of a larger capacity mining truck, citing the needs of large mining customers worldwide.</p>
<p>It said new tire technology, plus the company's extensive research and development programs, now make the design of a larger truck possible.</p>
<p>Caterpillar's current largest mining truck is the 793C with a payload capacity of 240 tons.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
